          "message": "feat(felixctl): Homebrew formula generated by the release (#1005) (#1064)\n\n* feat(felixctl): Homebrew formula generated by the release (#1005)\n\nrelease.yml writes Formula/felixctl.rb from the felixctl archives' .sha256\nfiles and pushes it to <owner>/homebrew-tap when PUBLISH_HOMEBREW is true.\nDry runs keep the formula as an artifact; nightlies skip the job. The\nfelixctl docs page gains the brew install and drops the stale claim that\nrelease binaries are not published.\n\nPart of #1005.\n\n* ci(release): push the Homebrew formula with a tap deploy key\n\n* docs(felixctl): Homebrew install, upgrade and uninstall",
